{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212070","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1121207001:0":{"text":"너희가 이루시카 님을 잡아갔지? 어서 그녀를 풀어줘!","source_cn":"伊露西卡女士被你们关在哪里？快放了她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69EFCE66E2F57B34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1121207002:0":{"text":"생사람 잡지 마. 우리가 잡아간 거 아니야. 그나저나... 이루시카가 정말 아직 살아있어?","source_cn":"别冤枉人，我们可没抓她。话说……她真的还活着吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D356E8A6F9865F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121207003:0":{"text":"당연하지! 이루시카 여사가 그렇게 쉽게 죽었을 리가 없잖아!","source_cn":"废话！伊露西卡女士怎么可能轻易死掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE593CA38071182A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的黑金残党":{"text":"블랙골드 잔당","source":"愤怒的黑金残党","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}